# macOS
.DS_Store
# Finder's custom-icon marker file (Icon + trailing CR). Written as a
# character class, not `Icon?`, because on macOS's case-insensitive
# filesystem `Icon?` also matches a plain directory named "icons".
Icon[!a-zA-Z0-9]

